# 🌱 EcoVision AI

EcoVision AI is an intelligent waste classification platform that uses Machine Learning + FastAPI + Web/Mobile Integration to identify and categorize waste from images.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 User Authentication (Login / Signup)
- 📸 Image Upload API
- 🧠 AI-based Waste Classification (TensorFlow / Keras)
- 📊 Prediction with Confidence Score
- 👨‍💼 Admin Panel
- 📝 Post & User Management
- 🌐 REST API with FastAPI
- 📱 Mobile + Web Ready Backend

---

## 🧠 ML Model

- Model: wasteClassify.keras
- Framework: TensorFlow + Keras
- Input: Image
- Output: Waste category + confidence

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

### Backend:
- FastAPI
- MongoDB
- TensorFlow / Keras
- Uvicorn

### Frontend:
- Next.js / React

### Others:
- JWT Authentication
- File Upload Handling
- REST APIs

---

