## ✨ New Features Added

| # | Feature | Description | Files Changed |
|---|---------|-------------|---------------|
| 1 | **Post Likes (Like/Unlike)** | Users can like or unlike any post. Likes are persisted in MongoDB, shown in real-time with optimistic UI updates. | `backend/app/models/post.py`, `post_service.py`, `routes/post.py`, `frontend/components/post-card.tsx`, `lib/api.ts` |
| 2 | **Search & Filter Explore Feed** | The Explore page now has a live search bar (filter by waste type or username) and a dropdown to filter by Recycled / Disposed / All. | `frontend/app/dashboard/explore/page.tsx` |
| 3 | **My Posts Page** | Dedicated page showing only the logged-in user's own posts, with a quick link to create a new post. | `backend/app/services/post_service.py`, `routes/post.py` (`GET /posts/mine`), `frontend/app/dashboard/my-posts/page.tsx` |
| 4 | **Leaderboard** | Ranks all users by eco points. Shows a top-3 podium, per-user CO₂ saved and post count, and highlights the current user's position. | `backend/app/services/user_service.py`, `routes/user.py` (`GET /user/leaderboard`), `frontend/app/dashboard/leaderboard/page.tsx` |

| 5 | **User Profile Page** | View and edit your display name. Shows a live stats summary (points, CO₂, posts). Name change updates the sidebar instantly via auth context. | `backend/app/services/user_service.py` (`get_user_profile`, `update_user_profile`), `routes/user.py` (`GET/PATCH /user/profile`), `frontend/app/dashboard/profile/page.tsx` |
| 6 | **Delete Own Post** | Users can delete their own posts from the My Posts page with a confirmation dialog. Backend enforces ownership — you can only delete posts you created. | `backend/app/services/post_service.py` (`delete_own_post`), `routes/post.py` (`DELETE /posts/{id}`), `frontend/app/dashboard/my-posts/page.tsx` |
| 7 | **Prediction History** | Every AI scan is saved to localStorage (last 20). The History page shows the image preview, waste type, confidence score, recyclability, and timestamp. Includes a clear-all action. | `frontend/lib/api.ts` (`savePredictionToHistory`, `getPredictionHistory`, `clearPredictionHistory`), `frontend/app/dashboard/history/page.tsx` |
| 8 | **Live Stats on Dashboard** | The home dashboard now fetches and displays real-time posts, points, and CO₂ saved in a stats strip inside the welcome banner instead of static placeholder cards. | `frontend/app/dashboard/page.tsx` |

